-- ---------- Not shown: the redirects in public ----------
--
-- Migration 0035 left a view under each old name in public (27) and a function under each old
-- function name (38), so a client that still asks for public reaches the same tables. They go
-- once the Data API offers faro (backlog 0c2). A rebuild doesn't need them.
